<sect1 id="UdpDelaySimRunner_8h_1DESCRIPTION">
<title>DESCRIPTION</title>
<para>This <ref refid="classTelemetryRunner" kindref="compound">TelemetryRunner</ref> class launches a thread that polls HDTN telemetry data. It also processes the data and provides interfaces for viewing it. </para>
</sect1>
